<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Access Denied - EGMS Portal</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .error-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
    }
    .error-card {
      background: rgba(30,41,59,0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .error-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7f1d1d, #991b1b);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .error-code {
      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #f97316);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .error-title { color: #f1f5f9; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .error-desc { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .error-role-info {
      background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #fca5a5;
    }
    .btn-back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-right: 0.75rem;
    }
    .btn-dash {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(99,102,241,0.12);
      color: #a5b4fc;
      border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2);
      padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-page">
    <div class="error-card">
      <div class="error-icon">🔒</div>
      <div class="error-code">403</div>
      <h1 class="error-title">{{t 'common.accessDenied'}}</h1>
      <p class="error-desc">
        {{t 'common.accessDeniedDesc'}}
      </p>
      <div class="error-role-info">
        {{#if isBn}}আপনার বর্তমান ভূমিকা: <strong>{{currentUser.role}}</strong> — এই পাতায় প্রবেশের অধিকার নেই।{{else}}Your current role: <strong>{{currentUser.role}}</strong> — does not have the required privileges.{{/if}}
      </div>
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-back">← {{#if isBn}}ফিরে যান{{else}}Go Back{{/if}}</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn-dash">🏠 {{t 'nav.dashboard'}}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
